■ Pleuritic chest pain: strongly suggests pleural irritation 
due to infection or a pulmonary embolus
■ Itching: if associated with jaundice, indicates intra- or 
extrahepatic cholestasis
''Soft'' symptoms
■ Dizziness
■ Light-headedness
■ Tiredness
■ Back pain
■ Headache
■ Wind', 5190),
