kindly and sympathetic approach by doctor and 
accompanying female nurse is always necessary.
Intact hymen
The possibility of rupturing or breaking the hymen 
during PE is an important consideration and is a par­
ticularly sensitive issue for women from some com­
munities. In such situations, judicious use of ultrasound 
may often give the appropriate information.
Pregnancy
Vaginal examination in pregnancy is discussed later 
in this chapter.
