of vision
Acute
■ Retinal detachment
■ Vascular (central retinal artery/vein thrombosis)
■ Angle-closure glaucoma
Chronic
■ Cataract
■ Macular degeneration
■ Open-angle glaucoma
■ Diabetic retinopathy
