■ Feelings of anxiety
■ Irritability
■ Inability to relax
■ Inability to concentrate
■ Worry/anxious rumination
■ Feeling of impending doom
■ Depersonalisation
■ Panic episodes (sudden onset of panic, sense of doom, 
