or having difficulties with how they are feeling, they 
have some rather odd experiences. Has anything very 
odd or unusual happened to you recently?'' Follow 
up on any positive responses with open questions, 
asking the patient to describe experiences in detail. 
If there are no positives, you can screen for certain 
sorts of delusions. Some of these, and suggested 
screening questions, are given in Box 8.22.
