Box 17.5  Procedure for Gram staining
■ Fix the smear on the slide by passing it through a flame 
twice
■ Stain with 2% crystal violet for 30 seconds, then wash 
with tap water
■ Stain with Gram''s iodine for a further 30 seconds and 
wash with water
■ Decolorize with acetone for a few seconds
■ Wash with water and counterstain with 1% safranin for 
10 seconds
■ After a final wash with water, dry by pressing between 
